## Scientific And Domain Assessments

### Complete two-candidate material identity and all eleven fields

identity: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Both actual complete payloads retain distinct local source-qualified identities, names, UNDEFINED_MIXTURE/OTHER classification, no global Top layer synonym, zero integration statistics and exact notes/components/assertion. One shared frozen name case does not merge two source-specific preparations.

### Every immediate and nested printed input and procedure

completeness: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Each retains100mL specific basal stock,1mL trace minerals,0.195gMES,0.042gNaHCO3,0.15gagarose and1mL trace vitamins, with full nested recipes. JCM629 explicitly replaces628four-salt carrier with its eight-salt carrier. Autoclave/cooling/pH/overlay instructions and PARTIAL retained-material closure remain. Water is not counted twice; bottom FeS layer/headspace excluded.

### Actual MICRO1408 parent and source-prescribed finished pH

grounding: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

The actual MICRO1408/NARROW_MATCH mapping is supported by source-prescribed finished pH6.1–6.4 within primary5.5–6.5 and explicit bacterial cultivation purpose. Local identities stay exact. This is not a permanent or post-growth measurement guarantee, full two-layer identity, salinity calculation, agar equivalence or role approval.

### Source batch, receiving quantity and chemical-form limits

quantity: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

All literal source-batch quantities and frozen101G_PER_L occurrence artifacts remain unconverted. Unknown initial pH reagent, titrant amounts/CO2 uptake/speciation, water input versus final yield, generic vitaminB12 and pantothenate stereochemistry remain precise holds. Parent classification resolves none of them.

### Exact selected MES, sodium bicarbonate and agarose applicability

identity: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Direct MES component is genericCHEBI39010 Mes.yaml, not adjacent W07-authored acid-family TARGET013CHEBI39005. NaHCO3 maps literal sodiumhydrogencarbonateCHEBI32139; agaroseCHEBI2511 remains generic polymer. Selected Agarose owner NBRC1326grade, rejectedSepharose and provisionalCARBON_SOURCE scopes do not transfer to JCM. Three nested preparations remain UNMAPPED; no exact vitamin owner chosen.

### Whole records independently reviewed, exact seven-leaf changes explained

provenance: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Four mapping scalars change, two LLM_SUGGESTION evidence objects and one truthful LLM-assisted event append per target. All four prior history events, previous mapping evidence and nine other complete fields remain exact. Filed comment predates event. Existing human/curator/component evidence is not retyped; native semapvManualMappingCuration projection is not human verification.

### Actual four-row native parent and registry projection

representation: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Claw76c projects each exact successor to MICRO1408broadMatch plus its own kgmicrobe.ingredient registry exactMatch. Four rows match author output and satisfy actual native invariants. No parent-identity collapse, synonym union or subclass_of substitution. Ancillary dictionary limits remain diagnostic, not canonical release.

### Frozen J native checks and exact selected context

consistency: supported. Targets: JCM628_Top_Layer, JCM629_Top_Layer.

Native closed schema/record checks and guarded byte idempotence pass. Partonomy passes J2956, J+two2958 and exact selected3550with two replacements. Nine controls verify actual failure behavior. J/Claw module code and inputs are rehashed, bytecode reuse avoided. No mutableI context, future fullprepare or wholecatalogscience accepted.

