- Assessment applies only to the two exact whole successor payloads and their genuine1case/2occurrence bindings. Other candidate families, all188sourceworker cases, and the parentpacket Marine-agar candidate receive no scientific approval.
- J immutable native context eac469f1 and Claw76c exact executed source/modules are the tested context. I has active author edits and was neither executed nor required. This is no waiver of a later application currentness check.
- Diagnostic selected3550partonomy and four-row projection do not equal whole-campaign nativeprepare, supported export/B4, whole-owner/role approval, registry integration or KGproduction release.
- Local identifiers remain separate; six component objects and three nested UNMAPPED scopes stay exact. No new component owner, parent-as-whole identity, stock equivalence, ingredient-form guess or global source alias.
- All unknown pH-adjustment reagent/CO2uptake, nestedKOHamount, source quantities/receiving-unit artifacts, addedwater versus finalvolume, vitamin forms and exactstock-routing holds remain. Prescribed finishedpH is not post-growth measurement or permanent guarantee.
- Direct dependency applicability does not approve wholeMes/Nahco3/Agarose owners, alias unions, molecular representations or roles. Adjacent W07 MES-acid source contribution is disclosed and excluded from own-byte or union approval.
- Prior and author-native observations remain immutable. Author self_review/needs_curation is not independent approval; its different issue key/target aliases are explained rather than silently migrated. Root owns issue disposition and eventual integration.
- W07 priorparent recommendation is disclosed; currentcandidate author is /root/step7d_science_c with genuine W08 source origins. Fresh separate successor_science, successor_technical and successor_skeptic reviewed actual completebytes.
- Original failed author/technical/report attempts remain retained. New report corrects only its scientific observation; no old hash/time/base changed.
- Actual local Git source bridges are verified; no new remotepublication claim. No source/J/I/maintained/source-Git/GitHub/gate/pin/code edits, paid provider, external new session or application. Private fixture Git metadata only locates the actual immutable base for the unchanged native helper; no commit/ref publication.
- Source input-freeze timestamp is actual; earlier manualreading start is not reconstructed. Original capture timestamps kept separately from new reads.
- Current native source base is genuine J eac; earlier independent report remains at its original0dacbase without rewritten pins.
- Expanded MES class/restriction read confirms chemical superclass scope, not prepared stock or selected acid/anion/zwitterion. Earlier root draft and validation retained; append-only v3 adds actual inspected inputs without scientific outcome change.
- No new findings require filing. Resolved oldfinding does not close wholeissue1237, supersede unrelatedsourceholds or authorize future application.

